# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# hustler.py has always been LF and cushion_path.py has always been CRLF.
# Left alone, the first tool to normalise either one produces a phantom diff
# of several hundred lines that hides the real change underneath it.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
